    35:{title:"બે રમતોની વેન આકૃતિ",caption:"બંને રમતા 10ને એક વાર ઘટાડો: 30 + 25 − 10 = 45; કોઈ નહીં = 5.",svg:`<svg viewBox="0 0 340 145" role="img" aria-label="ક્રિકેટ 30 અને ફૂટબોલ 25, બંનેમાં 10, કુલ 50"><circle cx="112" cy="70" r="49" fill="#22b8a6" fill-opacity=".15" stroke="#22b8a6" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="173" cy="70" r="49" fill="#8b7cf6" fill-opacity=".15" stroke="#8b7cf6" stroke-width="2"/><g fill="currentColor" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle"><text x="91" y="66">20</text><text x="143" y="66">10</text><text x="194" y="66">15</text><text x="87" y="30">ક્રિકેટ</text><text x="197" y="30">ફૂટબોલ</text><text x="270" y="60">બહાર</text><text x="270" y="82" font-size="18" fill="#22b8a6">5</text><text x="170" y="133" font-size="10">50 − (20+10+15) = 5</text></g></svg>`},
    37:{title:"8:30 વાગ્યાનો ખૂણો",caption:"મિનિટ કાંટો 180° પર; કલાક કાંટો 255° પર. તફાવત = 75°.",svg:`<svg viewBox="0 0 340 150" role="img" aria-label="8:30 વાગ્યે ઘડિયાળના કાંટા વચ્ચે 75 ડિગ્રી"><circle cx="92" cy="74" r="53" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".4" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M92 74L92 124 M92 74L52 99" stroke="#22b8a6" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M92 98 A24 24 0 0 0 77 55" fill="none" stroke="#8b7cf6" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="92" cy="74" r="4" fill="#8b7cf6"/><g fill="currentColor" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle"><text x="92" y="13">12</text><text x="92" y="143">6</text><text x="230" y="58" font-size="15" font-weight="700">75°</text><text x="230" y="80">8:30</text><text x="230" y="101">|255° − 180°|</text></g></svg>`},
