    39:{title:"અરીસાના સમયની રીત",caption:"સાચો સમય = 11:60 − અરીસામાં દેખાતો સમય.",svg:`<svg viewBox="0 0 340 100" role="img" aria-label="11:60 minus 3:40 equals 8:20"><rect x="8" y="14" width="94" height="54" rx="10" fill="#8b7cf6" fill-opacity=".12" stroke="#8b7cf6"/><rect x="122" y="14" width="94" height="54" rx="10" fill="#22b8a6" fill-opacity=".12" stroke="#22b8a6"/><rect x="236" y="14" width="96" height="54" rx="10" fill="#22b8a6" fill-opacity=".2" stroke="#22b8a6"/><g fill="currentColor" font-size="16" font-weight="800" text-anchor="middle"><text x="55" y="47">11:60</text><text x="169" y="47">− 3:40</text><text x="284" y="47">8:20</text></g><text x="170" y="88" fill="currentColor" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">અરીસામાં દેખાતો સમય → સાચો સમય</text></svg>`},
